Package: dirq-agent
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: DirQ agent — endpoint agent for fleet management
 Lightweight agent that runs on managed Linux servers, collects system
 data, relays queries through the P2P mesh, and optionally executes
 commands.

Package: dirq-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, postgresql
Description: DirQ server — Direct Query platform for fleet management
 Central server providing gRPC service for agents, REST API, query
 engine, and Ansible inventory endpoint.
